  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05Q6">Lemma <span data-tag="05Q6">4.27.17</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category and let $S$ be a right multiplicative system of morphisms of $\mathcal{C}$. The localization functor $Q : \mathcal{C} \to S^{-1}\mathcal{C}$ commutes with finite limits. </p>
